There have been several suggestions for note-taking in this thread..
But I do this now in nethack.  I always seem to carry something around that
I use the #name command for, and keep notes with it.  For example, that +0
wakazashi I'm carrying is a great place to keep notes.

While my notes are cryptic, I often record:

   o   The turn # I was at when I last prayed
   o   Levels with alters, and their alighnments.
   o   Shop levels, and for specialty stores, their stock.
   o   Levels where I've stashed stuff of interest

Well, I don't record *all* of these things all the time, but some times I'll
record a bunch of 'em.  Then, I'll end up throwing a +0 axe named 2157, la 3,
s 2/5, which gets a little confusing, cause then I end up having to pick up
a +0 axe named 2157, la 3, s 2/5.
